id: pm-memory-preparation-boundary-barriers
title: Make portable preparation contention tests independent of writer wait timing
description: "Run 43009567827 job 130485472749 fails as an unhandled competing-import rejection when the first import holds its writer lease beyond 30 seconds. Use explicit boundaries, immediate rejection observation and retry after release; do not relax the production lock. Separate from overlapping PR 51."
type: Issue
pm_format_version: 2
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: "gh:unbraind/pm-memory#61",release,tests
